    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} throws a bomb to a point it can see within 30 feet of itself. <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=m6sGoSTvZVqsvIsK]], each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on that point. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 8d6 average type=poison]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] condition until the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s next turn. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</p>",
